<title>HUNGARY: Hungary three-month T-bill rises to 22.56 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary three-month T-bill rises to 22.56 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of three-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 22.56 percent, down from 22.73 percent at an auction one week ago, the Government Debt Management Agency said on Wednesday  HTBN.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     11,498.65 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    22.56 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     94.6750 pct</p>
</text>
